{"id": "s1", "resume_skills": ["python", "pytorch", "llm", "rag", "nlp", "aws", "docker", "langchain", "transformer", "fine-tuning"], "jd_title": "Senior Machine Learning Engineer (LLM)", "jd_text": "We are building LLM-powered products and need a strong engineer. You must have Python and PyTorch, hands-on experience with large language models, RAG pipelines, embeddings and vector search. You will fine-tune transformer models and ship them to production on AWS with Docker. Strong NLP background required. Nice to have: LangChain, Kubernetes and prompt optimization experience. You will work cross-functionally with product and research teams to deliver reliable generative AI features.", "label": "strong"}
{"id": "s2", "resume_skills": ["python", "pytorch", "llm", "rag", "nlp", "aws", "docker", "langchain", "transformer", "fine-tuning"], "jd_title": "NLP Engineer", "jd_text": "Join our applied NLP team. Required: strong Python, deep learning with PyTorch, transformer architectures and hands-on fine-tuning of language models. You will build retrieval augmented generation systems and semantic search over large corpora. Experience deploying models with Docker on AWS is expected. Nice to have: LangChain and knowledge of embeddings and vector databases. We value people who can turn research into production NLP services.", "label": "strong"}
{"id": "s3", "resume_skills": ["python", "pytorch", "llm", "rag", "nlp", "aws", "docker", "langchain", "transformer", "fine-tuning"], "jd_title": "Data Scientist", "jd_text": "We are looking for a Data Scientist to drive product analytics. Required: strong Python, SQL, solid statistics and experience with A/B testing and causal inference. You will build machine learning models for classification and regression, and communicate findings via Tableau dashboards to stakeholders. Feature engineering and data analysis are core to this role. Nice to have: experience with recommendation systems. Comfortable working with cross-functional product teams.", "label": "medium"}
{"id": "s4", "resume_skills": ["python", "pytorch", "llm", "rag", "nlp", "aws", "docker", "langchain", "transformer", "fine-tuning"], "jd_title": "MLOps Engineer", "jd_text": "We need an MLOps engineer to own our model platform. Required: Docker, Kubernetes, Terraform and cloud infrastructure on AWS. You will build CI/CD for model deployment, set up monitoring and observability, and manage model serving and inference at scale with MLflow. Experience with GPU workloads is a plus. Nice to have: Python scripting and familiarity with SageMaker. You will partner with ML engineers to productionise their models reliably.", "label": "medium"}
{"id": "s5", "resume_skills": ["python", "pytorch", "llm", "rag", "nlp", "aws", "docker", "langchain", "transformer", "fine-tuning"], "jd_title": "Data Engineer", "jd_text": "Seeking a Data Engineer to build our batch and streaming pipelines. Required: strong Spark and PySpark, Hadoop, Kafka and Airflow orchestration. You will design ETL and data warehouse models in Snowflake and BigQuery, and write robust Scala and SQL. Experience with dbt and data pipeline reliability is essential. Nice to have: Databricks. This is a pure data platform role focused on scalable, well-tested pipelines for analytics and reporting.", "label": "weak"}
{"id": "s6", "resume_skills": ["python", "pytorch", "llm", "rag", "nlp", "aws", "docker", "langchain", "transformer", "fine-tuning"], "jd_title": "Backend Software Engineer", "jd_text": "Backend engineer wanted for our payments platform. Required: strong Java, Spring, microservices and REST API design, plus PostgreSQL and MySQL. You will design scalable systems, own service reliability and write thorough unit tests. Experience with Redis and message queues is valued. Nice to have: system design at scale. This role is about robust backend services and clean APIs, working closely with frontend and product teams.", "label": "weak"}
{"id": "s7", "resume_skills": ["python", "pytorch", "llm", "rag", "nlp", "aws", "docker", "langchain", "transformer", "fine-tuning"], "jd_title": "Frontend Engineer", "jd_text": "We are hiring a Frontend Engineer to craft delightful user experiences. Required: expert JavaScript and TypeScript, React, modern CSS and responsive design. You will build accessible, performant interfaces and collaborate with designers on a component library. Experience with Node.js for tooling is helpful. Nice to have: testing and CI/CD. This is a UI-focused role; no machine learning experience is required for day-to-day work.", "label": "none"}
{"id": "s8", "resume_skills": ["python", "pytorch", "llm", "rag", "nlp", "aws", "docker", "langchain", "transformer", "fine-tuning"], "jd_title": "Product Manager", "jd_text": "Product Manager to own our roadmap. Required: strong stakeholder management, agile and scrum delivery, and the ability to translate customer needs into requirements. You will work cross-functionally with engineering, design and leadership to prioritise features and ship outcomes. Experience with data-informed decision making and mentoring junior PMs is valued. This is a non-technical role focused on strategy, communication and execution.", "label": "none"}
